%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 280c4326a059df94fabc20b6d7fee8dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: SCENE1Narration
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  heading: THE CONCORD
  typingSpeed: 0.03
  punctuationPause: 0.15
  pauseGame: 1
  lines:
  - text: 'For a very long time, every intelligent species in the galaxy believed
      they were [wave]alone.[/wave] They were, of course, [shake]very wrong.[/shake]'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Eventually, civilizations found one another. Signals crossed the dark,
      ships crossed the stars, and intelligent life discovered that meeting aliens
      creates an absolutely [danger]horrifying[/danger] amount of paperwork.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: '[item]Trade agreements.[/item] [item]Travel laws.[/item] [item]Currencies.[/item]
      [item]Translation standards.[/item] [item]Diplomatic protocols.[/item] And
      several extremely serious arguments about who technically discovered whom first.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Someone had to organize all of it. Unfortunately, that someone was <color=#E7C15A>Graex
      Vohnuns.</color>
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Graex founded the [item]Inter-Species Trade Network[/item], better known
      as the [item]ITN[/item]. It [wave]connected[/wave] civilizations that had spent
      millions of years having absolutely nothing to do with each other.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Now they could trade, travel, communicate, borrow money, argue professionally,
      and file complaints across multiple solar systems.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The ITN handled [item]shipping[/item], [item]translation[/item], [item]banking[/item],
      [item]diplomatic communications[/item], and practically [wave]everything[/wave]
      else that needed to pass from one world to another.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: If something crossed a planetary border, there was a very good chance <color=#E7C15A>Graex
      Vohnuns</color> was making money from it.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: If something crossed a planetary border, there was a very good chance <color=#E7C15A>Graex
      Vohnuns</color> was making money from it.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They also called him [wave]many other things[/wave], usually when he wasn't
      in the room.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They also called him many other things, usually when he wasn't in the room.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: '[wave=0.5]One hundred years ago[/wave], the major civilizations signed
      the [item]Concord[/item]. For the first time, species could formally trade,
      travel and cooperate under the same agreement.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'It changed the galaxy. Worlds separated for entire histories could finally
      exchange knowledge, culture, technology and, occasionally, [shake]deeply [danger]regrettable[/danger]
      ideas.[/shake]'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'It changed the galaxy. Worlds separated for entire histories could finally
      exchange knowledge, culture, technology and, occasionally, [shake]deeply regrettable
      ideas.[/shake]'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'It changed the galaxy. Worlds separated for entire histories could finally
      exchange knowledge, culture, technology and, occasionally, [shake]deeply regrettable
      ideas.[/shake]'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'It changed the galaxy. Worlds separated for entire histories could finally
      exchange knowledge, culture, technology and, occasionally, [shake]deeply regrettable
      ideas.[/shake]'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Humanity is the newest civilization in the Concord. Very new. Some species
      attending tonight have been practicing interstellar diplomacy longer than humans
      have had indoor plumbing.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ideally, humanity would have sent an experienced ambassador. Someone important.
      Someone who actually knew what they were doing.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Instead... [wave]they sent [item]you[/item].[/wave]'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You are humanity's only representative tonight. A junior diplomat surrounded
      by some of the most powerful individuals in the known galaxy.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You have never attended a Concord gathering, never met Robert Robertson,
      and still aren't entirely convinced somebody didn't send the invitation to
      the wrong human.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: '[shake=0.3]Unfortunately...[/shake] [item]the invitation is [wave=0.2]real[/wave].[/item]'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'There is also a rumor. Robert Robertson intends to make an announcement
      tonight, and although nobody knows what it is, apparently [shake=0.2][danger]every
      important person in the room wanted to be there when he said it.[/danger][/shake]'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Tonight, you're having dinner with some of the most powerful people in
      the galaxy.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Tonight, you're having dinner with some of the most powerful people in
      the galaxy.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
